// Phase 5.3 tracer bullet: self-modifying code sandbox.
// A sandbox evaluates generated code in an isolated namespace and records an
// audit log of every effect. Here we evaluate a statement in the sandbox and
// inspect the recorded audit trail — proving isolation + observability.
begin
  var sb := sandbox();
  eval_in(sb, "println(1 + 2 * 3);");
  println(audit_size(sb));    // expect 1 (one logged effect)
end
